# The backend image is built with ./backend as the context and does `COPY . .`, so without this
# the test suite, caches, coverage data and any LOCAL SQLite database would be baked into the
# published image. Keep the image to what actually runs in production.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
tests
.venv
venv
env
.env
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/macroshock.db
results
.DS_Store
